                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game is ok. Has some UI issues here and there. Some of the lines weren't translated properly (in russian at least, it was machine translated, so the quality is bad) Feels awkward to play it using keyboard since camera movement is tied to arrow keys and not to mouse. Camera gets stuck sometimes making it impossible to move forward. Platforming doesn't have a koyote time (at least seems like it), not sure if it was on purpose.\n\nCan't say i enjoyed this game a lot. This is mostly about Reaper solving puzzles and getting frustrated at Carly being such a miserable human. If you like to solve puzzles and your friend loves platforming, then maybe you might like the game. But honestly this game lacks something. It needs polishing. We almost fell asleep during first two levels trying to catch all the fireflies.",
